{"unit_id":"TaoruiLiu19__dsh-gsv#card-zh","repo":"TaoruiLiu19/dsh-gsv","commit":"5bd350484b56ee7011898b5a62355e82e790eb25","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gsv-tts 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的语音朗读插件，提供本地 GSV 与联网 Edge 两种语音合成方式。它注册语音工具并接入设置和 Web 音频路由，可将助手回复转为可播放音频，也能自动朗读、切换音色并检查或安装本地引擎。用户可以管理音色预设并浏览音色市场。适合希望在 DSH 中收听回复、使用云端声音或通过参考音频进行本地音色合成的人。Edge 方式需要网络；GSV 方式需要本机 Python 和 GSV-TTS-Lite 引擎，不要求配置 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:37-50","src/index.ts:681-726","src/tts.service.ts:25-76","src/setup.ts:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"TaoruiLiu19__dsh-gsv#card-en","repo":"TaoruiLiu19/dsh-gsv","commit":"5bd350484b56ee7011898b5a62355e82e790eb25","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-gsv-tts adds speech to DSH Web through local GSV and online Edge providers. It offers speech tools, auto-read, voice selection, and engine checks. Users can manage presets or browse a voice registry. Edge needs network access; GSV needs Python and the local engine. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:37-50","src/index.ts:681-726","src/tts.service.ts:25-76","src/setup.ts:1-12"]}
